#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:5
#: f13e525eb3304baa95c7d9b9e5410a38
msgid "Archived: Build Your Own Multicopter"
msgstr "存档：自制多旋翼飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:8
#: ede68681dca34feab95bccf370995841
msgid "There are Lots of Ways you Can Put Together a MultiCopter"
msgstr "有很多方法可以组装多旋翼飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:10
#: fa1b36d6a1fc438d8af870d5a546fbf7
msgid ""
"Thoughtful, slow progression is better than jumping in with both feet, you "
"can easily get discouraged by trying to do too much too fast."
msgstr "深思熟虑、循序渐进比一步登天要好，尝试太快做太多事情很容易令人沮丧。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:13
#: 8bba91033bbf4565b8b7bef60fb0fbcf
msgid ""
"You are likely to have a good experience if you start with a simple, small "
"QuadCopter, either a Ready to Fly or an All Inclusive Kit."
msgstr "如果您从一款简单的小型四轴飞行器开始，无论是即飞型还是全套套件，您很可能会有良好的体验。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:15
#: 4d5a65e474614cbb9bcce849d0e011c3
msgid ""
"For those with good DIY capabilities an Almost Ready To Fly build like the "
"F450 FlameWheel described below can also work well."
msgstr "对于具备良好DIY能力的人，以下描述的F450 FlameWheel等接近即飞型（ARF）产品也能很好地使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:17
#: 6284151e436749d687d48a43bafb7eb6
msgid ""
"For your first MultiCopter, DO NOT initially try to build a Photo / Video or"
" First Person View copter, just build a good QuadCopter."
msgstr "对于您的第一架多旋翼，初期 **不要** 尝试制作航拍/视频或第一人称视角飞行器，先制作一架好的四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:19
#: a97e6aaeb4d548df91a8bad0f9586355
msgid ""
"Even if you know that's what you really want to do, it will take you some "
"time to come up to speed on our copters and autopilots."
msgstr "即使您知道那才是您真正想做的，也需要一些时间来熟悉我们的飞行器和飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:21
#: 6b552052d894463a98d52206972380d5
msgid ""
"If you just want to get a taste and have a lot of fun, try one of the little"
" inexpensive, safe, sturdy, ready to use Micro-QuadCopters below."
msgstr "如果您只是想尝尝鲜并享受乐趣，可以试试下面这些廉价的小型Micro四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:24
#: c84ca58b17b54db196f0031628017947
msgid ""
"If you know you're serious, try the **Flamewheel ARF Build** or if you just "
"want to fly and can afford it get the high end \\ **Iris** QuadCopter."
msgstr ""
"如果您认真了解自己的需求，可以尝试 **Flamewheel ARF制作**；如果您只想飞并且负担得起，可以购买高端的 **Iris** 四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:27
#: 7e048f837f4a4a38b736278a9b8801de
msgid ""
"The Iris includes a top end \\ **Pixhawk** autopilot and both the Iris and "
"the Flamewheel can do **FPV** or **Video** when you are ready."
msgstr ""
"Iris配备了顶级的 **Pixhawk** 飞控，当您准备好时，Iris和Flamewheel都可以支持 **FPV** 或 **视频**。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:30
#: 2a8106075a2f469bb07778c6f1c1a314
msgid ""
"Don't start with a \\ **Frame Up Build** unless you have a complete article "
"on how to build a really good simple Quadcopter like the Flip Sport."
msgstr "不要从 **Frame Up Build** 开始，除非您有一篇关于如何制作真正好的简单四轴飞行器的完整文章，比如Flip Sport。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:33
#: 4af00d9cbce2495ab82038a81fd3ebab
msgid ""
"Absolutely do not start by trying to **Build Your Own Frame**, even among "
"experienced builders there are more failures than successes."
msgstr "绝对不要试图从 **自制机架** 开始，即使是有经验的制作者，失败也多于成功。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:35
#: c71017874f194b69880119a8db35c36d
msgid ""
"It is very important to **NOT** start out with a big (dangerous) multicopter"
" with a bunch of photo or video stuff on it, you will regret it."
msgstr "**不要** 从一架带有大量拍照或视频设备的大型（危险的）多旋翼飞行器开始，您会后悔的。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:38
#: 3c454761cc424cd9a59b29808858df7e
msgid ""
"A small, agile **QuadCopter** is always a lot more fun to fly than a big, "
"ponderous and slow **Hex** or **OctoCopter** in any case."
msgstr "在任何情况下，小型灵活的 **四轴飞行器** 比大型、笨重且缓慢的 **六轴** 或 **八轴** 飞行器飞起来都有趣得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:40
#: 512986c3b07c4d7e86b47e87bf6c7c77
msgid ""
"Except for top end professional HD video or photography requiring big "
"cameras you are always better off thinking small, light and agile."
msgstr "除了需要大型相机的顶级专业高清视频或摄影之外，小型、轻量、灵活的方案总是更好的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:45
#: ee7e1a6ea3fe46f8843ee198d06f9f05
msgid ""
"Safety is very important with multicopters, keep plenty of distance from "
"living or expensive things and review our \\ :ref:`Safety Page <safety-"
"multicopter>`."
msgstr ""
"多旋翼飞行器的安全非常重要，请与有生命的物体或贵重物品保持足够距离，并参阅我们的 \\ :ref:`安全页面 <safety-"
"multicopter>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:49
#: 6b14d03a2e914fc7800a765f767a8113
msgid "Chinese Imports Good Deal / Bad Deal?"
msgstr "中国进口产品划算吗？"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:51
#: 94e126c96792465abf29659537bdad79
msgid ""
"It is very tempting especially when just starting out to buy lots of Chinese"
" direct import stuff because it is so much cheaper: Bad Idea!"
msgstr "尤其是刚刚入门时，很容易因为价格低廉而购买大量中国直邮产品：这是个坏主意！"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:53
#: 96993344266d4a0e9da7f1d7c281c19a
msgid ""
"As you gain experience, you will learn which import items are serviceable, "
"if you try to do it at the beginning things will not go well."
msgstr "随着经验的积累，您将学会哪些进口产品是可用的。如果从一开始就这样尝试，事情不会顺利。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:56
#: 115be8bde65e4f51b1f5e4c4379e7c02
msgid ""
"I recommend you always get the main electronics (autopilot) from the primary"
" source, in our case the Pixhawk from 3DRobotics."
msgstr "我建议您始终从主要来源获取主要电子产品（飞控），就我们而言是从3DRobotics购买Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:58
#: 8e022becfbb0448cb25ca43a652b1a95
msgid ""
"You will also want to get the electronic accessories (GPS, magentometer, "
"telemetry and OSD if used) from 3DRobotics as well."
msgstr "您还需要从3DRobotics获取电子配件（GPS、磁力计、数传和OSD（如使用））。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:60
#: 6f1237d0b76d473796ed26d3b9be051a
msgid ""
"If your going to do first person view, get a 3DRobotics FPV kit or a "
"FatShark Attitude video goggle and transmitter."
msgstr "如果要玩第一人称视角，可以购买3DRobotics的FPV套件或FatShark Attitude视频护目镜和图传。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:62
#: a1670fe158b14f0881923fd2b5abe47d
msgid ""
"As for cameras, the GoPro Hero 3 and especially the Black is the one to get,"
" because it is what everybody uses and it works well."
msgstr "至于相机，GoPro Hero 3，尤其是Black版是首选，因为它是大家都在用的，效果很好。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:64
#: 9d75409ea7af469eb969e8847ca58050
msgid ""
"The DJI Flamewheel ARF kit which is recommended is made in China but is a "
"known quality setup, so where you get it is up to you."
msgstr "推荐的DJI Flamewheel ARF套件产自中国，但是已知的高品质套装，所以从哪里购买取决于您。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:66
#: fe687a11a18047d082c96b3864cf4def
msgid ""
"The Traxxas, Hubsan and Helimax highly recommended starter micro-Quadcopters"
" are also made in China but are still a great way to start."
msgstr "强烈推荐的Traxxas、Hubsan和Helimax入门级Micro四轴飞行器也产自中国，但仍是很好的起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:69
#: 88b7843bb9784b13b70820b9ecb4b356
msgid ""
"Motors, Batteries, ESCs, frames and even FRSky or Turnigy RC transmitters "
"and receivers can be very good deals direct from China."
msgstr "电机、电池、ESC、机架，甚至FRSky或Turnigy遥控发射机和接收机，从中国直邮可以非常划算。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:71
#: 589482e0319b4c32bb9d526ef7b5c85e
msgid ""
"A lot of items we buy domestically are actually made in China and of course,"
" quality varies widely, regardless of country of origin."
msgstr "我们在国内购买的很多东西实际上都产自中国，当然质量差异很大，与原产国无关。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:73
#: 79dea81fbaff468599d1db9b98d58aed
msgid ""
"A $25.00 RC-Timer motor is not likely to be of the same quality as the "
"equivalent $100.00 Tiger-Motor, but hey, it's only $25.00."
msgstr "25美元的RC-Timer电机不太可能与100美元的Tiger-Motor质量相当，但毕竟只要25美元。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:75
#: d6624c3779e84d3e8721335f40b83af1
msgid ""
"Although direct Chinese imports generally have pretty reliable shipping, "
"aftermarket support or returns are often very problematic."
msgstr "虽然中国直邮产品的运输通常相当可靠，但售后支持或退货往往问题很多。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:77
#: 8a217387fcfc426d8f7294d51e84cb74
msgid ""
"If you build in a ten to twenty percent broken, damaged or not included "
"expectation for Chinese imports you will not be disappointed."
msgstr "如果您对中国进口产品预期有10%到20%的损坏、破损或缺件，您不会失望。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:80
#: d88ec80be501435db093e349aa30b119
msgid ""
"In any case, start with two or three of the recommended \"builds\" below so "
"that you can experience success and learn to fly first."
msgstr "无论如何，先从以下推荐的几款\"产品\"之一开始，这样您可以获得成功的体验并首先学会飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:84
#: 4de4542f287045c691240720ccfb4c28
msgid "Inexpensive, Ready To Fly Nano, Micro or Small QuadCopter"
msgstr "廉价即飞型纳米、Micro或小型四轴飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:88
#: cdef6c71a6934fe3985fffe7289ebfb8
msgid ""
"If you are new to MultiCopters, I very strongly suggest you start with one "
"of these inexpensive Ready To Fly QuadCopters."
msgstr "如果您是多旋翼飞行器新手，我强烈建议您从这些廉价即飞型四轴飞行器之一开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:91
#: 64ec1903efdd4caab0176d89cb4553e2
msgid ""
"They come with everything you need including the radio and the battery, "
"require no assembly, are very sturdy and are great for learning."
msgstr "它们包含您需要的一切，包括遥控器和电池，无需组装，非常坚固，非常适合学习。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:94
#: 51dcb0a4253f44608045ea7eb21760b0
msgid ""
"They are also a ton of fun, can easily and safely be used indoors and "
"typically cost less than a hundred dollars."
msgstr "它们也非常有趣，可以轻松安全地在室内使用，通常售价不到一百美元。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:96
#: 2fa3f6ff00eb4551bfb4d423b5d10832
msgid ""
"Importantly you will get you a much better understanding of how they work "
"and of what you really want to do next."
msgstr "重要的是，它们会让您对工作原理以及下一步真正想做什么有更好的理解。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:98
#: accb6b9b75e14bb0ab9e0f272a8c48a1
msgid ""
"The `Traxxas QR1 QuadCopter "
"<http://traxxas.com/products/models/heli/6208qr1>`__ is an inexpensive RTF "
"Micro Quadcopter that is great for a first experience. (Left image below)."
msgstr ""
"`Traxxas QR1四轴飞行器 <http://traxxas.com/products/models/heli/6208qr1>`__ "
"是一款廉价的即飞型Micro四轴飞行器，非常适合初次体验。（下图左）。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:101
#: aef41ef9dc994767be469007ef432f36
msgid ""
"For $45.00 the `(Hubsan X4) "
"<http://www.amazon.com/Hubsan-X4-H107-Copter-2-4GHZ/dp/B009M1PO7W>`__ is "
"identical to the Traxxas and for $70.00 you can get it with a still photo "
"and 720P HD video camera.\\ `Husban "
"<http://www.amazon.com/Hubsan-X4-H107-Copter-2-4GHZ/dp/B009M1PO7W>`__"
msgstr ""
"45美元的 `（Hubsan X4） "
"<http://www.amazon.com/Hubsan-X4-H107-Copter-2-4GHZ/dp/B009M1PO7W>`__ "
"与Traxxas相同，70美元还可以获得静态照片和720P高清视频相机。\\ `Husban "
"<http://www.amazon.com/Hubsan-X4-H107-Copter-2-4GHZ/dp/B009M1PO7W>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:106
#: ecfb54ff5182461795b016f67948751b
msgid ""
"For $200.00 there is even a really easy to fly **FPV** version of the "
"`Hubsan <http://www.ebay.com/itm/like/171203630670?lpid=82\">`__ that comes "
"with a RC transmitter with an excellent LCD display."
msgstr ""
"200美元甚至还有一款非常易飞的 **FPV** 版 `Hubsan "
"<http://www.ebay.com/itm/like/171203630670?lpid=82\">`__，配有带出色LCD显示屏的遥控发射机。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:109
#: a844f07e17354f86a3bcee8fa742fabb
msgid ""
"Even the parts for the Hubsans are readily available: \\ `Hobby Flip "
"<http://hobbyflip.com/>`__"
msgstr "甚至Hubsan的零件也很容易获得：\\ `Hobby Flip <http://hobbyflip.com/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:110
#: 6c6dc81b9b574c2085eb4e1cd8954473
msgid ""
"The \\ `Helimax 1SQ <http://www.helimax-"
"rc.com/helicopters/hmxe0834-1sq/index.html>`__ is another low cost palm "
"sized micro QuadCopter."
msgstr ""
"\\ `Helimax 1SQ <http://www.helimax-"
"rc.com/helicopters/hmxe0834-1sq/index.html>`__ 是另一款低成本的掌心大小的Micro四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:112
#: cb10106bf81449eb96c64534ba1e06ec
msgid ""
"Or even the really, really tiny $40.00 `Estes Proto X "
"<http://www.amazon.com/Estes-4606-Proto-Nano-Quadcopter/dp/B00G924W98>`__ "
"actually a Hubsan H111 which flies remarkably well (Middle and right images "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"或者甚至是非常非常小的40美元 `Estes Proto X <http://www.amazon.com/Estes-4606-Proto-Nano-"
"Quadcopter/dp/B00G924W98>`__ （实际上是Hubsan H111），飞行性能相当出色（下图中和右）。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:125
#: 8593654d73ab42efba079e96665b5191
msgid ""
"Below left is a larger, but very durable copter, the $88.00 UDI U818A 2.4GHz"
" Quadcopter with Camera from Amazon Prime."
msgstr "下图左是一款更大但非常耐用的飞行器：Amazon Prime上88美元的UDI U818A 2.4GHz带摄像头四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:127
#: 903a4b61dd4d4dffa6f84774f3da5b51
msgid ""
"And a link to an important `Blog Article by RocklandUSA "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/noob-quadcopter-training-thank-you-"
"community>`__ for all people considering their first Multicopter purchase."
msgstr ""
"以及RocklandUSA的一篇重要 `博客文章 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/noob-"
"quadcopter-training-thank-you-community>`__ 链接，供所有考虑首次购买多旋翼飞行器的人参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:129
#: 8e2173cdcb3e47ce93daf32515200527
msgid ""
"The Blade Nano QX at $90.00 below right is also highly recommended, is very "
"light and easy to fly and incredibly durable."
msgstr "下图右90美元的Blade Nano QX也强烈推荐，非常轻便易飞，且非常耐用。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:138
#: 81cd227f4bfa42e8ae3db22581f9ddcb
msgid ""
"If you are just starting out: Get one of these inexpensive, small, durable "
"Quadcopters and learn to fly it well, it will save you a lot of money."
msgstr "如果您刚刚起步：购买这些廉价、小型、耐用的四轴飞行器之一，好好学习飞行，这将为您省下很多钱。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:143
#: 4907ca5a2311437eae102916348af493
msgid "All Inclusive Kit"
msgstr "全套套件"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:145
#: de68dd01dbc74dac89eef7d604eadcd1
msgid ""
"#. The easiest way to build is to buy a single kit that has all the parts "
"necessary in one box and a set of instructions for each step."
msgstr "#. 最简单的制作方法是购买一个包含所有必要部件的单一套件，并附带每个步骤的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:148
#: 71e2a627e2da4ceb85c61ba7be5e60a0
msgid ""
"#. Outside of (Ready To Fly) a good all inclusive kit is the most reliable "
"and straightforward way to construct a quality MultiCopter."
msgstr "#. 除（即飞型）外，好的全套套件是制作高质量多旋翼飞行器最可靠、最直接的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:151
#: a630fd85fc1445cda3cc4c337dac4da5
msgid ""
"#. Usually all of the components are well balanced with each other and the "
"entire craft can be expected to perform well."
msgstr "#. 通常所有组件相互之间搭配良好，整架飞行器可以预期表现良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:154
#: 7778b05f98224ba391735139f9d115c0
msgid ""
"#. For an all inclusive kit, assembly is just nuts and bolts and possibly "
"some soldering."
msgstr "#. 对于全套套件，组装仅仅是螺丝螺母和可能的一些焊接。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:157
#: a7b0fa20ac574fab9b9378e08fbe0fa6
msgid ""
"#. The assembly procedure is usually well explained in the supplied "
"instructions."
msgstr "#. 组装程序通常在随附说明中有很好的解释。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:160
#: 9b88990be3444bc3a9fd951da8ad7123
msgid ""
"#. The downside is that often quality kits are a bit more expensive than "
"other alternatives and customization has to be added on."
msgstr "#. 缺点是高质量套件往往比其他替代品贵一些，个性化定制需要额外添加。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:163
#: c9065d6a7e99428d8f612fe95dfbc8a9
msgid ""
"#. If you are not already well qualified at Do It Yourself projects, A good "
"all inclusive kit is definitely the best place to start."
msgstr "#. 如果您还不擅长DIY项目，好的全套套件绝对是最好的起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:166
#: 079a245bbfab4c279bf002f2df6f96db
msgid ""
"#. The innovative `Iris QuadCopter "
"<https://www.amazon.com/3DRobotics-3DR0171-3DR-IRIS-"
"Quadcopter/dp/B00NWXY076>`__ is actually \\ **Ready To Fly** and comes with "
"the top of the line **Pixhawk** autopilot. However, these are no longer "
"produced/sold by 3DR."
msgstr ""
"#. 创新的 `Iris四轴飞行器 <https://www.amazon.com/3DRobotics-3DR0171-3DR-IRIS-"
